stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> CanonicalDocument
  CanonicalDocument --> SupervisorAgent: processor tool evidence
  SupervisorAgent --> ClassificationReview: ambiguous / conflict
  SupervisorAgent --> APSubgraph: DISPATCH_AP
  SupervisorAgent --> ARSubgraph: DISPATCH_AR
  APSubgraph --> APException: PO / GR / variance control fails
  APSubgraph --> PaymentJournal: match + approval policy passes
  ARSubgraph --> ARException: allocation control fails
  ARSubgraph --> CashApplication: match + approval policy passes
  ARException --> ARSubgraph: corrected and re-matched
  ARException --> Resolved: rejected or manually resolved
  APException --> PaymentJournal: explicit AP decision policy
  APException --> Resolved: rejected
  PaymentJournal --> [*]
  CashApplication --> [*]
  Resolved --> [*]
